flowchart TD
    PC_START([Pending]) --> PC_PROMOTE{PM promotes<br>to shortlist?}
    PC_PROMOTE -->|Yes| shortlisted[shortlisted]

    shortlisted --> S_INT{Interview<br>or bind?}
    S_INT -->|Interview| interviewing[interviewing]
    S_INT -->|Bind| bound[bound<br>homeowner committed]
    S_INT -->|Un-shortlist| PC_PROMOTE

    interviewing --> I_DEC{Either party<br>walks away?}
    I_DEC -->|Yes| declined[declined]
    I_DEC -->|No| I_DONE{Homeowner has<br>enough info?}
    I_DONE -->|Yes| interviewed[interviewed]
    I_DONE -->|Another round<br>video / chat / site visit| interviewing

    interviewed --> IV_DEC{Either party<br>walks away?}
    IV_DEC -->|Yes| declined
    IV_DEC -->|No| IV_BIND{Homeowner<br>binds?}
    IV_BIND -->|Yes| bound[bound<br>homeowner committed]
    IV_BIND -->|Another round| interviewing

    bound --> C_RESP{Contractor<br>responds}
    C_RESP -->|Accepts| PC_DONE([In Progress])
    C_RESP -->|Requires visit| interviewing
    C_RESP -->|Declines| declined

    style PC_START fill:#FF9800,color:#fff,stroke:#F57C00
    style PC_PROMOTE fill:#fff,color:#000,stroke:#F57C00
    style shortlisted fill:#FFE0B2,color:#000,stroke:#F57C00
    style interviewing fill:#FFB74D,color:#000,stroke:#F57C00
    style interviewed fill:#FF9800,color:#fff,stroke:#F57C00
    style bound fill:#F57C00,color:#fff,stroke:#E65100
    style declined fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff,stroke:#616161
    style PC_DONE fill:#2196F3,color:#fff,stroke:#1976D2
    style S_INT fill:#fff,color:#000,stroke:#F57C00
    style I_DEC fill:#fff,color:#000,stroke:#F57C00
    style I_DONE fill:#fff,color:#000,stroke:#F57C00
    style IV_DEC fill:#fff,color:#000,stroke:#F57C00
    style IV_BIND fill:#fff,color:#000,stroke:#F57C00
    style C_RESP fill:#fff,color:#000,stroke:#E65100
